  "vendor_website": "belimo.com",
  "description": "Communicative 6-way characterised control valve with flow sensor (6-way EPIV): setpoint, position, flow, sequences, service flags and configuration",
  "revision": 1,
  "revised": "2026-11-15",
  "source": "Belimo, 6-way EPIV Modbus Register, en-gb 2024-01",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "6-way EPIV Modbus Register",
      "version": "en-gb 2024-01",
      "url": "https://www.belimo.com/mam/general-documents/system_integration/Modbus/belimo_Modbus-Register_6way-EPIV_en-gb.pdf",
      "note": "Modbus register description",
      "accessed": "2026-11-15",
      "sha256": "38f8920c185a2bf165f08750e19df1511054dbca7a2a808aa1629fd23c861606"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Modbus RTU over RS-485: 1-8-N-2 by default (also N-1, E-1, O-1), 9600 to 115200 bd (factory 38400), address 1 to 247 (factory 10). Parameterised with the Belimo Assistant App.",
    "All registers above 100 are persistent: do not write them regularly.",
    "All registers are holding registers (functions 3 and 6; 4, 2 and 16 also accepted). The manual numbers registers from 1 (No.) and from 0 (Address); the Address column is used here (address base 0).",
    "32-bit values take two consecutive registers, least significant word first.",
    "A register not supported by the device or its settings reads 65535.",
    "Written from the manufacturer's register description; not tested on a device."
  ],
  "protocol": "rtu",
  "unit_id": 10,
  "baudrate": 38400,
  "parity": "N",
  "databits": 8,
  "stopbits": 2,
  "byte_order": "big",
  "word_order": "little",
  "address_base": 0,
  "x_status": "official",
